                                        "entry_id": "dd21679f-7672-3d60-bd60-4f9b2a7f6966",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "H₃BO₃; B(OH)₃; a white crystalline solid, soluble in hot water to form a weak acid. Used as a mild antiseptic, flame retardant, insecticide, and in the manufacture of borax and other borate salts."
